OL,3,GNEWSAAlleged spy feared 'humiliation'
OL,4,Aof conviction, says friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Royal Marine found dead days
OL,7,Fafter he was charged with national
OL,8,Fsecurity offences feared the
OL,9,F"humiliation" of a potential
OL,10,Fconviction, a friend has told an
OL,11,Finquest.
OL,13,FMatthew Trickett, 37, had appeared in
OL,14,Fcourt charged under the National
OL,15,FSecurity Act and was found in a park in
OL,16,FMaidenhead on 19 May 2024.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
