OL,3,GNEWSAAlleged spy feared 'humiliation'
OL,4,Aof conviction, says friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fassisting the Hong Kong intelligence
OL,8,Fservice on 1 May, he was seen to
OL,9,Fattempt self-harm in his cell on 11
OL,10,FMay. He was released on bail two days
OL,11,Flater.
OL,13,FJack Williams, a close friend of
OL,14,FTrickett's having served with him in
OL,15,Fthe Marines, stayed with him at his
OL,16,FMaidenhead flat the night before he
OL,17,Fdied.
